  perform public.add_offseason_program('Off-Season – Basketball', 'For Basketball: an 8-week off-season program. It builds a higher vertical jump, soft and strong landings, tough ankles and knees, quick lateral movement for defence, and the repeated-sprint fitness to play hard all game. Each week has 2 strength sessions (Monday lower body plus a row, Thursday upper body plus hips, so every muscle is trained twice a week), 1 conditioning session (Tuesday), 1 speed and power session (Friday) and 1 easy recovery session (Wednesday: zone 2 cardio and mobility). Saturday is for playing your sport or resting, Sunday is full rest. Weeks 1-3 build strength and fitness (sets go up each week), week 4 is a recovery week at half the sets, weeks 5-7 turn that strength into power and sport-specific fitness, and week 8 is a test week at half the sets: test your best clean set on the main lifts, a broad jump and a 20 m sprint, then you''re ready for pre-season. No set goes to failure: stop each set with 1-2 good reps left. In weeks 1-3 sprint at 9/10, then all-out from week 5.',
