  perform public.add_offseason_program('Off-Season – Enduro Riding', 'For Enduro and off-road motorbike riding: an 8-week off-season program. It builds legs and hips that hold the standing position for hours, grip and forearm endurance to fight arm pump, a strong upper back, neck and core to control the bike, and a big engine for long, hard sections. Each week has 2 strength sessions (Monday legs, Thursday upper body and grip), 1 conditioning session (Tuesday), 1 power and core session (Friday) and 1 easy recovery session (Wednesday). Saturday is for riding or resting, Sunday is full rest. Weeks 1-3 build strength and fitness (sets go up each week), week 4 is a recovery week at half the sets, weeks 5-7 turn that strength into power and sport-specific fitness, and week 8 is a test week at half the sets: test your best clean set on the main lifts, a dead hang and a 2 km row, then you''re ready for pre-season. No set goes to failure: stop each set with 1-2 good reps left.',
    nutrition, warm_up, '{"1": "Strength A: legs & hips", "2": "Conditioning & grip", "3": "Active recovery: zone 2 + mobility", "4": "Strength B: upper body, grip & neck", "5": "Power & core", "6": "Ride your bike or rest", "7": "Full rest"}'::jsonb,
